            %h6#proof_8 Proof
            %p
              By prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PrequantumGaugeTransformation"}
              the prequantum filler of the diagram is given by a function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
